sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant RT as Route p2h atau findings
  participant PSH as push.js
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant VND as Web Push vendor
  participant SW as Service Worker HP
  RT->>PSH: notifyEvent(kind, severity,<br/>siteId, actor)
  PSH->>DB: INSERT notifications
  alt VAPID belum diisi
    PSH-->>RT: sent 0, hanya dalam aplikasi
  else VAPID aktif
    PSH->>DB: SELECT push_subscriptions<br/>yang berhak
    PSH->>VND: sendNotification<br/>(TTL, urgency) lewat web-push
    alt diterima
      VND-->>PSH: sukses
      PSH->>DB: UPDATE last_ok_at,<br/>fail_count 0
      VND->>SW: push event
      SW->>SW: showNotification dan<br/>beri tahu jendela terbuka
    else 404 atau 410
      PSH->>DB: DELETE push_subscriptions
    else galat lain
      PSH->>DB: fail_count + 1,<br/>hapus bila 8 atau lebih
    end
  end
